 with Democrats period  every study tells us this we're going to  talk about that later in the week  it's the Republican Party that has  carried out this massive multi-decade  campaign of gaslighting and influence  peddling and slowly pushing away from  actual democracy because on the issues  they are running out of voters and then  when you add to this the benefit of  gerrymandering which we've talked about  because the censuses have been  conveniently timed to allow them to  do that you add to that control of the  courts most recently the Supreme Court  which Donald Trump has been an  incredibly useful operator to now get  them decades more control of the Supreme  Court and what you very quickly realize  is that unless the left gets it together  immediately I'm talking like tomorrow  they've left has to get it together  tomorrow and I'm gonna talk in the next  segment about the Russia issue related  to this it's over for 2020 and we are  going to see many many more years of  this

